    "https://jobs.pepperdine.edu/jobs/search/rotational-program": {
      "title": "Strategic Project Associates (SPAs)",
      "description": "Rotational Program Home Staff Opportunities Featured Careers Department of Facilities Services Rotational Program Temporary Opportunities Public Safety College of Health Science Why Pepperdine View All Jobs Applicant Login My Settings Kiosk mode Strategic Project Associates (SPAs) The Strategic Project Associate (SPA) program is a rotational program designed for individuals interested in exploring various long-term career opportunities at Pepperdine. Housed within the Human Resources department, the SPA program allows individuals to gain skills and experience in various departments and functional areas across the University. SPAs rotate from department to department every 1-3 months, providing high-level administrative support to each area as they go. Upon hire, SPAs undergo a training period in Human Resources during which they become acquainted with the University's organizational structure, the different functions of HR, the University’s major systems and business processes, and key stakeholders. SPAs are then sent to their first assignment where they integrate into their new department but remain connected with Human Resources and their Human Resources supervisor throughout the duration of their time in the program. Most SPAs go on to accept full-time positions at Pepperdine following a period of about 1-2 years. Past SPAs have accepted positions in a variety of areas across the University, including but not limited to Advancement, the Boone Center for the Family, Business Services, the Department of Design and Construction, Human Resources, the Office for Community Belonging, and Seaver College. Apply Now There are currently no jobs matching this criteria Pepperdine Careers 24255 Pacific Coast Highway Malibu, CA 90263 310.506.4397 Quick Links Home Staff Opportunities Why Pepperdine Hiring Process Applicant Login My Settings Copyright © 2026 Pepperdine University Candidate Details This website uses cookies. We use cookies to personalize con