l Counsel (0 items) 0 Graduate School of Education and Psychology (1 items) 1 Human Resources (1 items) 1 Information Technology (0 items) 0 Integrated Marketing Communications (0 items) 0 Pepperdine Graziadio Business School (0 items) 0 Planning, Operations and Construction / Facilities Services (0 items) 0 Provost (0 items) 0 School of Public Policy (0 items) 0 Seaver College (0 items) 0 Student Affairs (1 items) 1 SVP Strategic Implementation (0 items) 0 Design Template Search 1 filter options found Design Template 676_NOAPPLY_OQVMH (0 items) 0 Employment Category Search 2 filter options found Employment Category Faculty (0 items) 0 Staff (5 items) 5 Search by job title, location, department, category, etc. Search Temporary Finance Support Liaison (Part-Time) Business/Accounting/Finance Temporary Finance Staff This position will support Pepperdine’s Finance Department in supporting University-wide adherence to Pepperdine’s University Financial Policies and support the Controllership Team with logistical and procedural needs. Read more Temporary Talent Pool (Malibu, Calabasas, West Los Angeles, Irvine) Administrative/Office Support Temporary Human Resources Staff Pepperdine University Human Resources invites qualified individuals to join its Temporary Talent Pool. This placement program connects candidates with temporary, on-call, or short-term assignments across Pepperdine’s operational areas and schools. Individuals accepted into the Temporary Talent Pool may be referred to hiring departments as opportunities arise based on their qualifications, availability, campus preferences, and departmental needs. Read more Temporary Front Desk Agent, Villa Graziadio Administrative/Office Support Hospitality Temporary Chief Operating Officer Staff The Temporary Front Desk Agent at Villa Graziadio will play a key role in providing exceptional customer service and creating a welcoming environment for guests at the Villa Graziadio Executive Center. As the first point of contact, the Front Desk staff will assist with check-ins, manage guest inquiries, and provide administrative support to ensure smooth operations of the facility. The position requires a strong focus on delivering an outstanding guest experience, aligning with the Villa Graziadio's mission to host successful events and provide an atmosphere of learning and inspiration. This role will be essential in providing the professional and efficient service expected in this premier conference and retreat destination located on the picturesque Pepperdine University Malibu campus.\n\nApplications for this position are reviewed on a rolling basis as needs arise. Candidates selected for this applicant pool may be contacted to fill on-call vacancies caused by absences or other short-term staffing needs. If a suitable opening becomes available, we will reach out based on qualifications and availability. Please note that being part of the applicant pool does not guarantee placement. Read more University Field Supervisor Pool- Graduate School of Education and Psychology M.A. in Teaching Academic Support Temporary Graduate School of Education and Psychology Staff This role serves as a liaison between candidates, mentor teachers, and university personnel. They support, observe, and evaluate multiple or single-subject pre-service teacher candidates for effective practices and dispositions toward teaching. Read more Part Time Counselor Counseling/Clinical Temporary Student Affairs Staff The Counseling Center holds a confidential space where Pepperdine students can receive support around a variety of mental health concerns with a wide range of severity. Read more Displaying all 5 entries Pepperdine Careers 24255 Pacific Coast Highway Malibu, CA 90263 310.506.4397 Quick Links Home Staff Opportunities Why Pepperdine Hiring Process Applicant Login My Settings Copyright © 2026 Pepperdine University Candidate Details This website uses cookies. We use cookies to personalize content such as job recomme