    "https://jobs.pepperdine.edu/why-pepperdine": {
      "title": "Why Pepperdine",
      "description": "Why Pepperdine Home Staff Opportunities Featured Careers Department of Facilities Services Rotational Program Temporary Opportunities Public Safety College of Health Science Why Pepperdine View All Jobs Applicant Login My Settings Kiosk mode Why Pepperdine Mission and Vision Benefits Wellness Professional Development Community Belonging Spiritual Life History At a Glance \"At Pepperdine, faculty and staff are not seen merely as employees, but as whole people with personal, professional, and spiritual commitments. Just as our mission is to provide students with transformative education to strengthen them for lives of purpose, service, and leadership, we expect faculty and staff to work in ways that transcend transaction and enable flourishing in every aspect of life. In many ways, we are less employees and more ambassadors of the Pepperdine way of life.\" Sean Michael Phillips Associate Vice President, Human Resources and Business Services STAFF OPPORTUNITIES AT PEPPERDINE Search by job title, location, department, category, etc. Search Pepperdine Careers 24255 Pacific Coast Highway Malibu, CA 90263 310.506.4397 Quick Links Home Staff Opportunities Why Pepperdine Hiring Process Applicant Login My Settings Copyright © 2026 Pepperdine University Candidate Details This website uses cookies. We use cookies to personalize content such as job recommendations, and to analyze our traffic. You consent to our cookies if you click \"I Accept\". If you click on \"I Do Not Accept\", then we will not use cookies but you may have a deteriorated user experience. You can change your settings by clicking on the Settings link on the top right of the device. Manage Consent Preferences Strictly Necessary Cookies These cookies are necessary for the website to function and cannot be switched off in our systems. They are usually only set in response to actions made by you which amount to a request for services, such as setting your privacy preferences, logging in or fi